# Arriving: when the first of you comes home, the heating goes back up.
workflow arriving
about When the first of you comes home: the heating back to <home temp> °C, and a line saying so.
start trigger:first-home
tag no
limits steps 10, days 1

step heat
tool home/home_set {"action": "temperature", "device": "<thermostat>", "value": "<home temp>"}
on fail goto failed
if heat starts done goto warm

step unsure
say {event.person} is home. I set the heating to <home temp> °C, but the <thermostat label> hasn't confirmed: {heat}
end

step warm
say {event.person} is home. The heating is set to <home temp> °C.
end

step failed
say {event.person} is home. The heating didn't change: {heat.error}
